# AlarmApp docs

- Product docs (`docs/00`–`07`, `09`) stay **Turkish**. Do not rewrite PRD/UX into English agent prose.
- **`CHANGELOG.md`:** end-user Turkish only — friendly sentences, no file paths / agent toolkit jargon.
- **`memory.md`:** short project memory for agents; update when durable state changes.
- Agent tooling docs live in `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/` (**English**).
- References: `docs/09-referans-kaynaklar.md` is links + mapping only — **no** git submodules, no `vendor/` clones of Ice Cubes/Clendar/etc.
- When contracts change (e.g. `WatchMessage`), update `docs/03` in the same change set as code.
- Phase plans/specs: `docs/superpowers/plans/`, `docs/superpowers/specs/`.
